     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><A name=_GoBack></A><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>绍兴一中“鲁家贤奖学金”历年资金使用情况说明</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>鲁家贤先生是绍兴一中的杰出校友代表，先生不忘初心，感恩母校。虽长期定居国外，但一直情系故土，热心公益，捐资助学。</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，鲁家贤先生通过当时的绍兴市外侨办，在绍兴一中捐资设立我校历史上第一个奖学金，其爱心善行，至今为母校师生传颂。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>现将我校颁发使用“鲁家贤奖学金”的历年明细情况与绍兴市侨办鲁家贤专项账户资金明细情况说明如下：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><FONT size=3><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>一、绍兴一中“鲁家贤奖学金”历年明细</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>．因鲁家贤先生是华侨，按相关政策，所有奖学金至今均由绍兴市外侨办（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年调整为“侨办”）负责接收、管理，由其设立单独账户存入银行，专款专用。到</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3> 2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，根据绍兴市市级机关财务管理要求，鲁家贤奖学金专项账户撤消，归入“绍兴市归国华侨联合会”账户，从此不再计息。学校每年根据《鲁家贤奖学金试行办法》，先评定获奖名单，再据此向外侨办申请、领取相应奖学金（奖学金只用本金产生的银行利息颁发，本金没有动用）。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT size=3>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>侨办负责鲁家贤奖学金工作的人员为沈秀德处长，联系手机：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>13065559882</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>．</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3> 1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年奖学金设立时，鲁家贤先生出资人民币</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>20548.10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，此后有几年还有其它数额不等的资金追加，全部奖学金本金为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>39948.10 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>．</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年——</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1998</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年奖学金颁发使用情况：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年第一届奖学金按一等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>200</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元、二等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>150</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元、三等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>100</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元标准颁发，共计</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1350</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，向外侨办领取和颁发；</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1988</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年、</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1989</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年第二届、第三届奖学金按三个年级一等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>120</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元、二等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>80</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元、三等奖</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>50</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元标准颁发，共计</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2400</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，向外侨办领取</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>3400</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，颁发后学校结余</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1989</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，学校奖励全校教师（</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>129</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>人）每人</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>50</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，共计</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>6490</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，其中学校经费支付</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>5206.92</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，欠缺部分征得鲁家贤先生同意，从鲁家贤奖学金学校结余的</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元中支用</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1283.08</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，还余</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>716.92</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
