<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1989</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，鲁家贤先生又出资</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元存入专项账户，用于学校购发毕业纪念册。自后至今，没有再追加奖学金本金。</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>以上本金合计存入银行账户：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>39948.10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年到</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>月，全部本金产生的利息总计为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>57102.93</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，加上本金</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>39948.10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，全部收入为：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>97051.03</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2015</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>月鲁家贤奖学金不再单独存银行，归入“绍兴市归国华侨联合会”统一账户，不再生息，截止</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>12</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>月</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>31</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>日，账户余额</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>31968.03</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，已经转入绍兴一中教育基金会账户，单独财务计账。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年第十五届支出</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>7000</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，目前余额</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>24968.05</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>．奖学金支出情况</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>◇除</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1987</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年奖学金支出金额为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>1350</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元外，其余年份每年奖学金支出金额均为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>3400</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，至</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>年，全部奖学金支出金额为</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>65083</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=3> </FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>．全部收入</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>97051.03</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元减去全部奖学金支出金额</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>72083</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元，目前余额</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3>24968.03</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><FONT size=3>元。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
